; different dimensions shouldn't be mistaken for one another

print conforms? `m3 `s/m3
print conforms? `m4 `s/m2
print property 1`s/m3
print property 1`m3

; ...not even with user-defined units

a: 1`apples
b: 1`pears
c: 1`plums

print conforms? a * c b * b
print conforms? a * b b * a
print (a * b) + 1`pears.apples
